<h3>Non-AC for short or cool trips</h3>
<p>At ₹20 per km, a two-day, 600 km trip costs 600 × ₹20 = ₹12,000 plus ₹1,000 Bata, about ₹13,000, a saving of ₹1,200 over the AC rate. That is about ₹100 per person for 12. In winter on a hill route this can make sense. For summer or plains routes, choose AC.</p>

